<title>NEW ZEALAND: RALLYING-LEADING POSTIONS IN NEW ZEALAND RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-LEADING POSTIONS IN NEW ZEALAND RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND, New Zealand 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions</p>
<p>of the New Zealand Rally at the end of the opening stage (2.10</p>
<p>kms) on Saturday:</p>
<p> 1. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru one minute and 33 seconds</p>
<p> 2 equal. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru	   1:35</p>
<p> 2 equal. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi	 1:35</p>
<p> 2 equal. Juha Kankkunen (Finland) Ford		1:35</p>
<p> 5. Richard Burns (Britain) Mitsubishi		 1:36</p>
<p> 6. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford			    1:37</p>
</text>
